<title>HONG KONG: Cathay Pacific announces board changes.</title>
<headline>Cathay Pacific announces board changes.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cathay Pacific Airways Ltd said in a statement on Thursday Zhuang Shoucang has retired from its board and would be replaced by Carl Yung, general manager of CITIC Pacific Ltd.</p>
<p>Lydia Dunn has also resigned from the board after 11 years as a director and has been appointed as an adviser for two years, it said.</p>
<p>Benjamin Wong, a director at Swire Pacific, has also resigned, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
